  "prompt": "Cho hình chóp đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có đáy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, cạnh bên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Tính khoảng cách giữa hai đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (làm tròn kết quả đến hàng phần trăm).",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": "3.74",
  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>J</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>J</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>J</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>J</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>14</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>74</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/c23de0aabef45e278e6ba4a9d46546dd14ad35b689f1804bf272f08dd63d4356.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
